1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Ludwig I, von Stockhausen:''' Birth: about 1530 Stockhausen near Meschede, Sauerland, North Rhine-Westphalia, Germany. Death: 1597-07-25 Stockhausen near Meschede, Sauerland, North Rhine-Westphalia, Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ludwig I. von Stockhausen (* around 1530, †1597), the oldest, was Schulte and high court lay judge'''. He was '''married to Elisabeth von Plettenberg zu Lenhausen''', '''a granddaughter of Heinrich von Plettenburg zu Lenhausen'
2 CONC '', known as''' "das Verken,"''' and had seven with her Children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''German Wikipedia Stockhausen(noble family)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
