1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Ludwig I. von Stockhausen''' (* around 1530, †1597), the oldest, was Schulte and high court lay judge. He was married to '''Elisabeth von Plettenberg zu Lenhausen, a granddaughter of Heinrich von Plettenburg zu 
2 CONC Lenhausen''', known as "das Verken," and had seven with her Children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''German Wikipedia Stockhausen(noble family)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elisabeth Schulte zu Ennest (born von Stockhausen)''', 1560 - 1585 Elisabeth Schulte zu Ennest (born von Stockhausen) was born in 1560, at birth place, to '''Ludwig I. von Stockhausen''' and Elisabeth von Stockhausen (born von 
2 CONC Plettenberg zu Lehnhausen). Ludwig was born circa 1530, in Stockhausen bei Meschede, Sauerland, Nordrhein-Westfahlen, Deutschland. Elisabeth was born circa 1545, in Lenhausen bei Finnentrop. Elisabeth had 8 siblings: '''Johanna An
2 CONC na Elisabeth Schulte von Ennest (born von Stockhausen), Ludwig II. von Stockhausen''' and 6 other siblings. '''Elisabeth married Johann Schulte zu Ennest''' in 1585, at age 25. Johann was born in 1555, in Enste, Hochsauerlandkreis
2 CONC , Nordrhein-Westfalen, Germany. His occupations were Hoferbe, Landwirt und Schulte zu Enste and Beerbter|Beerbter|Beerbter. They had one son: Johann Schulte zu Ennest. Elisabeth passed away in 1585, at age 25 at death place.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
