1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Arnold III von Stockhausen''', Birth: 1450 Stockhausen, Meschede. Death: 1520 Stockhausen, Meschede x '''NN from Calle zu Rüthen''' ca 1450-
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Arnold III. Schulte zu Stockhausen (* around 1445 ) was lord of Calle and Stockhausen'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jodokus Schulte zu Stockhausen (* 1474 ), his son, was born on 20 July 1519 was with the Good Stockhausen invested. 1519 came yet Hovestadt and Buck's yard to. He married around 1500 Bela of Langenohl, with the he four sons had. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''German Wikipedia Stockhausen(noble family)'''
2 CONT
