2 CONC Enste. Johanna was born in 1560, in Stockhausen. Johann had 5 siblings: Jost Schulte von Ennest, Judoka Schulte von Ennest and 3 other siblings. '''a. Johann''' married '''Elisabeth von Ennest (born von der Hardt)''' in 1618, at a
2 CONC ge 33. Elisabeth was born on January 15 1592, in Bilstein. They had 2 children: (Ludovicus) Ludwig Schulte von Ennest and one other child. '''b. Johann married Maria Schulte Schulte zu Ennest (born Kreiggen).''' They had one daugh
2 CONC ter: Elisabeth Korte (born von Ennest). Johann passed away on month day 1650, at age 65 at death place.
2 CONT
