1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Arnold II of Stockhausen, Richter zu Calle''', Birth: about 1420 Stockhausen, Meschede Death: 1474 Gut Kalle, Stadt Meschede, x Catharina von Lenhausen ca 1425
2 CONT
