2 CONT
2 CONT Arnold II. von Stockhausen, (* around 1410, †1474) was also a judge in Calle. 1451 married he Catharina of Lehnhausen.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''(German Wikipedia Stockhausen(noble family)'''
