1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Hermann Schelmann''' ca 1610- -Niederberndorf. Deceased 26 December 1656 - Beisinghausen, aged about 46 years old1656
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of''' Heinrich Baust (around 1585 - after 1627), Hermann Schelmann from Niederberndorf''' appears as heir to the court. '''Either Heinrich Baust's marriage was now childless and Hermann Schelmann was installed as h
2 CONC eir''', or:''' Heinrich Baust was born in Niederberndorf and married the heir's daughter in Beisinghausen.''' From the scant documentary material, something more precise cannot be ascertained ... 1648 = Boss tho Bosinghausen belon
2 CONC gs to the farms owned by Schulte zu Landenbeck (State Archives Miinster, Stift Meschede, I.ehnsarchiv, files 5a)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Clara Lohman aka Clara Baust''' married son(NN) of Ebert Schulte zu Landenbeck. Her father and mother was '''Hermann Schelmann gnt. Baust ca 1610-1656 and Elisabeth Lohmann ca 1620-1686'''. After the death of Heinrich Baust (ar
2 CONC ound 1585 - after 1627), Hermann Schelmann from Niederberndorf appears as heir to the court. Either Heinrich Baust's marriage was now childless and Hermann Schelmann was installed as heir, or: Heinrich Baust was born in Niederbern
2 CONC dorf and married the heir's daughter in Beisinghausen.
2 CONT
