2 CONC ost%26n%3Dlohmann&usg=ALkJrhiHR7wjivWBu4mIYyABFbbdBckPiw 
2 CONT
2 CONT 07/03/1638 = Ebert Schulte zu Landenbeck commits himself to good things as liege lord to the Struwen Büemke the interest from both the 5 Rtlr., As well as of the 5 Rtlr. To pay Maria Stoer'sche memorial money, if Struwen should st
2 CONC ay behind. He pledged the Wiesenkamp behind the Büemke chapel adjoins Cordes Kamp. Witnesses: Pastor Caspar Berghoff, Hermann Lohmann, Thonies Scheiwe, both lay judges and provisional officers. Signature: Eberdt Schulte to lamb co
2 CONC rner. (From a booklet with copies of old documents in the parish archive of Reiste, pages 15-16)
2 CONT
2 CONT https://translate.googleusercontent.com/translate_c?depth=3&hl=en&prev=search&rurl=translate.google.com&sl=de&sp=nmt4&u=https:%2F%2Fgw.geneanet.org%2Fgoed%3Flang%3Dde%26pz%3Dandreas%2Bhagen%2Bandreas%26nz%3Dgodde%26p%3Djodocus%2Bj
