1 NAME Petrus Josephus /Hofman/
2 GIVN Petrus Josephus
2 SURN Hofman
2 _MARNM Hofman
2 NICK Piet Hofman
1 NAME Petrus Josephus (Piet) Hofman
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 19 SEP 1859
2 ADDR
3 CITY Woerden
3 STAE Zuid-Holland
3 CTRY Nederland
1 DEAT
