1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Judge Arnold von Stockhausen,''' (* around 1380 ) took over the property in 1400. He is probably identical with one Arnoldus de Stockhusen, the 1405 and 1411 documented appear and progenitor of the race was. '''
2 CONC Arnold was judge of the Calle and Villicus free chair of the estate Stockhausen''' as a fief of the pin Meschede. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''German Wikipedia Stockhausen(noble family)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT In the year 997 was the Schultenhof( curtis maior ) Stockhausen first time as a center of about 20 yards above . Emperor Otto III. outlawed the owner Hunold and transferred the farm to the Meschede monastery. A forecast for was Hu
2 CONC nold then with 20 sons executed. Only the youngest had the massacres survived and was later as vassals to the Good returned. Hans from Stockhausen was in 14 . Century owner of Stockhausen. He was with Agnes of mirrors married and 
2 CONC died 1375. At the time the Oberhof Stockhausen was subordinate to 22 courtyards , u . a . in Mülsborn, Calle, Olpe, Wennemen, Visbeck, Altenhellefeld, Wedinghausen, Westenfeld, Hellefeld and Frenkenhausen. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''German Wikipedia Stockhausen(noble family)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
