1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1. '''Clara Lohman aka Clara Baust married son(NN) of Ebert Schulte zu Landenbeck.''' Her father and mother was Hermann Schelmann gnt. Baust ca 1610-1656 and Elisabeth Lohmann ca 1620-1686. After the death of Heinr
2 CONC ich Baust (around 1585 - after 1627), Hermann Schelmann from Niederberndorf appears as heir to the court. Either Heinrich Baust's marriage was now childless and Hermann Schelmann was installed as heir, or: Heinrich Baust was born 
2 CONC in Niederberndorf and married the heir's daughter in Beisinghausen.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. 01/20/1663 = Johannes Lohmann, priest and conventual of the Grafschaft monastery, Hermann Lohmann, the younger to Lohof, Tonis Lohman (gt. Frisse) to Reiste, Elsen Bausten zu Beisinghausen, Gertrud Möller'sche zu Fretter, all b
2 CONC iological brothers and sisters, complain for herself and '''Clara''', her sister's daughter ('''who to the young Schulte Landenbeck had''' '''married) against old Schulte zu Landenbeck for insulting'''. He is supposed to be in the
2 CONC  presence of Baustes at Beisinghausen on Sunday, October 4th, 1662 others have said: her sister (his son's wife) "namely his son's fraw, I don't want to give him anything to eat ".... He should withdraw and pay a fine to the tax a
2 CONC uthorities. (Original paper certificate at the Lohof) (See: previous document from 1663)
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. '''Zweit- oder Abschrift Sterbefälle | KB001b-03-Zs'''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://data.matricula-online.eu/de/deutschland/paderborn/DE_EBAP_63417/KB001b-03-Zs/?pg=8
2 CONT
2 CONT Anno    1677 10. Junij sepulta Clara Schulten ex Lammecke uxor
2 CONT
2 CONT In the year 1677 June 10, buried his wife '''Clara Schulten of Lammecke'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. '''Zweit- oder Abschrift Trauungen | KB001b-01-Zh'''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://data.matricula-online.eu/de/deutschland/paderborn/DE_EBAP_63417/KB001b-01-Zh/?pg=5
2 CONT
2 CONT 1652   7. Juli: copulatus est Ebert Schulte zu Langenbecke cum Clara Lohmans coram testibus multis
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1652   7. Juli''', coupled with''' Ebert Schulte zu Langenbeck Clara Lohman''', with the presence of many witnesses
2 CONT
