1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Julius Koch Gt. Möller'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Family tree print •	Born about 1645 - Meschede •	Died after 1687 - Meschede
2 CONT
2 CONT •	Married 24 July 1667, Meschede, to Anna Maria Hilgenhövel ca 1650-1704 
2 CONT
2 CONT Julius Der Hennemöller Birth: calculated 1645 — <Meschede, Kurfürstentum Köln, Niederheinisch-Westfälischer Reichskreis, Germany> Death: wife	 Clara Baust Birth: December 27, 1649 — Beisinghausen, Nordrhein-Westfalen, Germany Deat
2 CONC h: about 1680 Marriage: June 26, 1674 — Meschede, Kurfürstentum Köln, Niederheinisch-Westfälischer Reichskreis, Germany child	 '''Pn Möller''' Christening: April 15, 1675 30 25 — Meschede, Kurfürstentum Köln, Niederheinisch-Westfä
2 CONC lischer Reichskreis, Germany Death: April 15, 1675 — Meschede, Kurfürstentum Köln, Niederheinisch-Westfälischer Reichskreis, Germany son	 '''Peter Möller''' Christening: March 16, 1677 32 27 — Meschede, Kurfürstentum Köln, Niederh
2 CONC einisch-Westfälischer Reichskreis, Germany Death: son	 '''Hilgerus Möller''' (Hilgerus Jodocus (Hilgerus) Möller) 1678- / 1723 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT Note to the person
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1686 = Probstei- (or Ruhr-) Mill: Profit Letter for Julius Möller (Hennemöller)'''  '''(Staatsarchiv Münster, Meschede Abbey, file no. 511)''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT The '''Sauerland''' is that part of '''Germany''' formed by the northern edge of the Rhenish-Schist massif, at the foot of which the '''Ruhr River''' flows. It is a vast plateau cut by deep valleys into which tributaries of the ''
2 CONC 'Ruhr''' '''flow.''' '''Meschede lies at the confluence of one of them, the Henne, and the Ruhr'''. Before the industrialisation of the Ruhr in the 19th century, it was an agricultural area.
2 CONT
2 CONT Julius Koch  He was born about 1645 in Meschede. He was baptized. Geloof: r.K. Profession: Müller. He died after 1687 in Meschede.
2 CONT
2 CONT Household of Julius Koch He is married to Anna Maria Hilgenhövel on July 24, 1667 at Meschede.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes by Julius Koch 1686 = Probstei- (oder Ruhr-)mühle: Gewinnbrief für Julius Moller, (Staatsarchiv Münster, Stift Meschede, Akten Nr. 511)
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Maria HILGENHÖVEL , born about 1650 in Meschede (religion: rK ).  Church wedding on 24.07.1667 in Meschede withJulius KOCH (Möller) , Müller , born about 1645 in Meschede (religion: rK ), died after 1687 in Meschede , 1686 = 
2 CONC Probstei (or Ruhr) mill: winning letter for Julius Moller, (State Archives Münster, Stift Meschede, Akten Nr 511) .
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: Individual note:-
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1687 godfather of Anna Maria Hilgenhövel from Eversberg, daughter of Severin Hilgenhövel to Eversberg'''  (KB Eversberg)
2 CONT
2 CONT Godparents: Julius Koch (or Möller - Ruhrmöller - husband of the sister of the father) and Margaretha Drusemann.
2 CONT
2 CONT Julius Der Hennemöller Geburtsname: Julius Muller Geschlecht: männlich Geburt: Zwischen 1644 und 1646 - '''Heirat: Ehepartner: Clara Baust - 26. Jun. 1674 - Meschede, Kurfürstentum Köln, Niederheinisch-Westfälischer Reichskreis,''
2 CONC ' Germany Heirat: Ehepartner: Anna Margaretha Schulte - nach 1680 Ehepartner: Clara Baust, Anna Margaretha Schulte
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
