1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The 11th child and 3rd son of A. M Muller, married Rosina E Rautenbach in 1787. Then had a 2nd wife Anna v Rensburg of Doornfontein, Albertina, where he also later died and was buried 14 January 1828.  They had 14 
2 CONC children. A rich man, who's farms Roodebloem (3,500 Riksdalers) and Patrysfontein (2,000 Riksdalers) were then sold along with slaves (some for 3,000 riksdalers each). 
2 CONT
2 CONT His eldest son Antonie Michael settled in east near Patensie, Humansdorp. His 2nd son George Frederic followed his brother and settled in Uitenhage and today family members are found on Korhaansdrift in Sondagsriver valley. His 3r
2 CONC d son Hilgard inherited Kleinberg and family are spread on Roodehoogte, Rooidrif, Potkleiskraal, Goedemoed,Bartelsfontein, Klipfontein and Albertina, Riversdale, Ladybrand, in OFS Warden, Heilbron, Bultfontein, Rhodesia (Zimbabwe)
2 CONC  De Leewen, Melkhoutessenbos, Dagbreek, Uitkyk and Skadudal.    
2 CONT * Reference: [http://person.ancestry.com.au/tree/23346130/person/1377455217 Ancestry Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 13 2016, 13:17:48 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Gebeurtenisse:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.	Michael Arnoldus Mülle rse vader ontval hom op ouderdom een jaar 2.	Sy nageslag bevat die meeste Müllers 3.	Sy huwelik verbind die Müllers met Portugal-Ingestuuur Ds. MG Muller
