1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Franco von Heygen,''' born around 1300 (religion: rK ), died after 1365 , urk. 1327-1365, 1379 dead, 1347 '''squire''', 1338 in the property register of Count Gottfried IV. Arnsberg at the feudal estates Franco 
2 CONC de Heggen with a Mansus in Heggen and the fishery in Ahausen including the accessories and elsewhere with a mill, a fishery in Ahausen, 1/1 Mansus and one in Heggen; In 1347 he and his '''wife Katharina''' sold their forest in Tec
2 CONC klinghausen to the pastor zu Helden for his church. '''Son of Herbort von Heygen'''. Married to '''Catharina von Wenne''' , born around 1310 (religion: rK ), died after 1347, urk. 1347, daughter of N von Wenne.
