1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gertrud_von_Plettenberg '''Gertrud von Plettenberg'''] (15??-26 October 1608), was administrator of several castles of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Electorate_of_Cologne Elector
2 CONC ate of Cologne] and royal mistress of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ernest_of_Bavaria Ernest of Bavaria], Prince-Elector-Archbishop of Cologne. The couple may have married morganatically in secret around 1605.
