2 CONT ===Life===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gertrud von Plettenberg''' was a member of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/House_of_Plettenberg House of Plettenberg]. Her family was poor and she was given a position at the court of Ernest of Bavaria in Arnsberg, Hirschber
2 CONC g and Höllinghofen. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Because of her, Ernest''' primarily resided at Arnsberg from 1595 onward. Gertrud and Ernest were lovers from 1595, and reportedly married secretly in 1605. She had one son and one daughter with Ernest. From 1598, she is mentio
2 CONC ned by contemporaries as his hostess. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''There were rumors''' at her death that she had been poisoned by the duchess of Cleves.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT
