2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''Conrad III. von Hüsten (Ketteler),''' born around 1285 (religion: rK ), died 1364 , before August 13th. '''urk. 1306-1363, 1364 dead, 1328 knight, Burgmann in Hachen and Rüden''', 1313 a. 1338 by the Gfn. v. Arnsberg enfeoffed 
2 CONC with 2 farms in Müschede, 6 Mark pension from the main farm in Menden, 1 farm in Niederense, 1 farm in "Overendorp" (Oventrop or Uentrop), 2 farms in Mülsborn, the main farm "curtis" in Bruchhausen near Arnsberg, 1 farm in Hüsten 
2 CONC with all its feeding places, 1 courtyard of the main Snellenhus farm, 1 farm in Linnepe, 1 farm in Weneme and two other farms in Müschede, 1350 Drost zu Arnsberg.
