2 CONT Please be patient with me here. These are my thoughts, '''to try and get to docs and facts'''! It is not by lack of trying to get this profile sorted, that there are no docs. I have tried for many many years! This is my brickwall!
2 CONC
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''How I see it currently:''
2 CONT
2 CONT ''This profile here -  is not to be confused or merged with:''''''
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. '''Her daughter in law and the daughter in law's child:''' : 
2 CONT The daughter in law, was my own great grandmother: '''Maria Adriana Van Niekerk''' x Thomas Ignatius (Edward) Slabbert - and they had a '''daughter''' '''Maria Adriana Slabbert''', who died young (her nickname - '''Bubbles''') 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  This profile's sister:
2 CONT  '''Her sister and the sister's child:''' 
2 CONT '''Adriana Maria Ferreira''' *1771 - +1788  x Johannes Jacobus Kock  - 
2 CONT and '''the sister's child''': a daughter named '''Adriana Maria Kock'''. We have a baptism doc for her. As far as i can work it out - this is '''not this profile's baptism doc, but the sister's doc.''' Your opinion? 
2 CONT Detail Source: https://www.ancestry.com/discoveryui-content/view/500132:60152?ssrc=pt&tid=105304415&pid=330046090256
2 CONT Name:	Adriana Maria '''Fereyra'''
