2 CONT 3. '''Caution: The Kock and Slabbert wives''' 
2 CONT  I am however maybe starting to think, that these two profiles ie (the one married to J J Kock and the one married to G J Slabbert could be '''smergded''' and that they actually '''might be the same person and not sisters! ?''' No
2 CONC t confirmed yet! BUT: How do we decide if they are the same or are not the same person? Your valued opinions are appreciated! 
2 CONT ''@Wilma, my conclusion is that this is exactly what has happened. They are the same person, and in fact the marriage to Slabbert is incorrect. There is no documentation, after ages of searching, that this woman existed with this 
2 CONC name... there are baptism records for all the siblings but none for her... she is not the mother of any of GJ Slabbert's children, and she is not mentioned in SAG.
2 CONT PH20220513''
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. The problem with '''the same sounding names''': 
2 CONT Why is her name, written by my grandmother- as '''Maria Adriaan'''? '''  
2 CONT (The pic is however placed with the right profile here! 
2 CONT This pic is according to what I know - '''not Adriana Maria Slabbert'''! )''' 
2 CONT Need to make sure of the names again! 
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.''' According to my grandmother's handwriting''' : They were well to do Ostrich farmers in Oudtshoorn.(Grandma's handwriting is not very easily readable on the back of this picture, but I can make out what is written on there.  
2 CONC It says: She was apparently quite strict, very religious and he was a gentle soft spoken and kind man. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. '''Ferreira Name Confusion/ different spelling recording versions on documents:''' 
2 CONT In documents in the Cape Archives Repository the Ferreira's family name is given in different ways given such as honorable '''Verere, Verrere, Ferraire, Ferrera, Vreira, Freeden, Feryra, Ferrida, Fereira, Feirera, Feraira and Ferr
2 CONC aira'''. These variations are probably written versions of the sounds that the Dutch officials at the expression of the surname Ferreira heard! Might also sometimes be spelling/ recording mistakes however?
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.Note '''her spelling of her birth surname as Fereyra or Fereijra, which differs to Ferreira''' - maybe just a recording error/ spelling variants? 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Her father's marriage''' doc shows the spelling as '''Feraira'''. - WB
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:S3HT-6LX3-F6K?i=25
2 CONT '''Stephanus Feraira	Male'''	Single	03 Mar 1765	Stellenbosch, Cape of Good Hope, South Africa	Jacomina Aletta Muller	Female	Single	004434404	004434404	713	14434	14434
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. Note: ''' caution re picture''': 
2 CONT People have unfortunately grabbed this photo of mine and erroneously placed it with''' Adriana Maria Slabbert's profile x Kock  on myheritage!''' Their birth dates should '''not''' be the same - '''unless''' they actually are smer
2 CONC ged profiles . Confusion?
2 CONT
