2 CONT PLEASE NB:  This Adriana Maria Ferreira x Kock , is not to be confused with her sister: Maria Adriaan Ferreyra (Ferreira) x G J Slabbert.  (Maria Adriaan Ferreyra's picture is placed correctly with her own profile and her husband 
