2 CONT '''Ignatio Leopold Ferreira''' * Portugal c. 1696, skipbreukeling v.d. Britse skip Chandos wat op 16 Junie 1722 in Valsbaai sink, tree eers in diens v.d. VOC maar word burger in 1737 en boer op die plaas De Hartebeeste Kuil † 24.8
2 CONC .1772 ten ooste v.d. Gouritsrivier x Stellenbosch 6.11.1735 Martha TERBLANCHE
2 CONT * '''b3 Petrus Hendrik''' = Paarl 5.8.1736, burgerkommandant en woonagtig te Misgund in die Langkloof sedert 1771 x 28.12.1760 '''Catharina Maria VAN STADEN''' † 26.1.1779 xx 23.1.1780''' Martha Johanna MULLER
2 CONT '''
2 CONT * Played an important role in social and military matters, was leader of a commando that drove Bantus back across the Fish River, during the Second Xhosa War he was lieutenant in Swellendam's 'dragonders' and was in charge of a co
2 CONC mmando, an excellent shot and brave elephant hunter, spoke Hottentot language fluently.
2 CONT
