1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Röttger I. von Hüsten,''' born around 1245 (religion: rK ), died after 1300 , urk. 1270-1300, 1270-1287 '''Knappe, 1299 Knight, 1275 Burgmann zu Arnsberg''', received around 1280 for life together with '''Anton 
2 CONC Wrede from Count v. Arnsberg''' Hachen Castle as a fiefdom, renounces the goods sold by his father in 1274 to the Ölinghausen monastery in 1287, renounces goods in Specteshole (near Soest) in 1299 in favor of the Welver monastery,
2 CONC  1299-1300 graef. Amtmann (dapifer) zu Arnsberg.
2 CONT
