2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Dorothea MULLER  was born on 10 Jun 1815 in Dist. Uitenhage, Kaapkolonie. She was christened on 11 Nov 1815 in George, Kaapkolonie. She died on 11 Aug 1856 in Malmaison, Kirkwood, Kaapkolonie. She married Isaac Abraham MULLE
2 CONC R on 28 Oct 1844 in Uitenhage, Kaapkolonie. Maria signed a will on 31 May 1856 in Malmaison, Zondagsrivier, Kaapkolonie. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT    M i Anthonie Michiel MULLER was born on 10 Feb 1847. He was christened on 16 May 1847 in Uitenhage, Kaapkolonie, Kaap de Goede Hoop. He died as a child.  
2 CONT
2 CONT    F ii Alewijna Jacoba MULLER 
2 CONT
2 CONT    M iii Stephanus Johannes MULLER was born on 4 Feb 1850 in Oliphantshoek, Alexandria. He died on 26 Jul 1875 in "Own dwelling", Malmaison, Zondagsrivier, dist. Uitenhage.  
2 CONT
2 CONT    M iv Isaac Abraham MULLER was born calculated 10 Nov 1851 in Alexandria. He died 20 mei 1882 in Malmaison.  
2 CONT
2 CONT    F v Maria Magdalena MULLER was born about 1852/1854.  
2 CONT
2 CONT    M vi Cornelis Johannes MULLER  was born estimated 1853/1855.  
2 CONT
2 CONT    M vii Anthony Michael MULLER was born estimated 1854/1856. 
