1 NOTE {geni:about_me} My research pointed to Anton Michiel Van Niekerk marrying Dorothea Maria Claringbould on 14 August 1842 in Uitenhage, Cape. Their one son Richard Davidson, born in about 1847 (my great-grandfather) married my great
2 CONC -grandmother of which my family knows absolutely nothing. I  confirmed that he fought in the Anglo-Boere War of 1899-1902 and was sent to India as prisoner of war and returned to South Africa in 1902. My "unknown" granny was sent 
2 CONC to the concentration camp in Pietermaritzburg and returned to the farm in 1902. I am still searching for the data of my great-grandmother.
2 CONT
