1 CONT known as Brinker on Johan's birth certificate
0 @N6000000005029348016@ NOTE
1 CONT Born in Menkhausen (info from baptismal register of son Ferdinand)
1 CONT Emigrated to US between 1846 and 1849.  (Daughter Josephine born Westphalia in May 1846 and son Anthony born in Hamtramck Mich in June 1849)
0 @N6000000005029355289@ NOTE
1 CONT Call her self daughter of Baron von Driesbach
0 @N6000000005026869477@ NOTE
1 CONT Born out of wedlock before the marriage of his parents at Gleidorf (birth register of the town of Graftschaft)
1 CONT said to have lived in Nierentrop, Smallenberg.  Family tradition recorded the place as Nehventroph.
0 @N6000000005029353585@ NOTE
1 CONT 1890,  millinery, 858 Gratiot aveue
1 CONT Buried Mt Olivet cemetery
0 @N6000000005029345402@ NOTE
1 CONT 16 children
